#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Draw window frames using &titlebar colors"
msgstr "Finsterrahmen in de Klören vun den &Titelbalken teken"

#: config.cpp:43
msgid ""
"When selected, the window borders are drawn using the titlebar colors; "
"otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat aktiveert is, warrt de Rahmen vun Finstern mit de sülve Klören "
"teekt as  de Titelbalken; wenn nich, warrt de normale Klören bruukt."

#: config.cpp:49
msgid "Draw &resize handle"
msgstr "&Greep för't Ännern vun de Grött wiesen"

#: config.cpp:51
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab handle\" in the bottom "
"right corner of the windows; otherwise, no grab handle is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat aktiveert is, wiest all Finstern en Greep in't Höörn rechterhand "
"nerrn."

#: config.cpp:56
msgid "Actions Settings"
msgstr "Aktschonen instellen"

#: config.cpp:58
msgid "Double click on menu button:"
msgstr "Dubbelklick op den Menüknoop:"

#: config.cpp:60
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Do nix"

#: config.cpp:61
msgid "Minimize Window"
msgstr "Finster minimeren"

#: config.cpp:62
msgid "Shade Window"
msgstr "Finster oprullen"

#: config.cpp:63
msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Finster tomaken"

#: config.cpp:66
msgid ""
"An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it "
"to none if in doubt."
msgstr ""
"En Aktschoon kann to den Dubbelklick op den Menüknoop toornt warrn. Wenn Du "
"nich seker büst, weer dat villicht beter, nix to ännern."
